OL,16,Fpictures safely and responsibly, and
OL,17,Fthat they are not edited or enhanced
OL,18,Fusing AI.
OL,20,FIf you submit an image, you do so in
OL,21,Faccordance with the BBC's terms and
OL,22,Fconditions.
